Charges from third-party APIs
-----------------------------

Searches are executed against third-party search APIs (Yandex, Google,
apiserpent, SerpBase, SearXNG and similar) using API keys supplied by the
person who deploys and operates the service. Any charges for those requests
are billed by the respective provider under that person's own agreement with
the provider. The authors and contributors of SerpentSeek are not liable for
such charges, nor for any other material damage arising from the use or
inability to use the software (see GPLv3 sections 15 and 16: the program is
provided "as is", without warranty of any kind).

Operators are strongly advised to configure billing budgets, alerts and
API-key quotas on the provider side, and to keep retry counts and attempt
limits in chain settings at reasonable values.

